class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: within a 32 KiB firmware image, a console line in a receive buffer is checked as text, split at a found = and a found arrow into views of the buffer, its value's scalars stepped at their offsets, and encoded again scalar by scalar into a fixed reply that refuses a four-byte scalar in three bytes with no_space and a surrogate with invalid_scalar, writing nothing, while a scalar it does not hold is text.not_found
program: main.ldn
root: ../../../../..
status: 42
